; Vt3: swi-decoding-code with two functions (the name to number one, the number to name one) beside a SWI chunk with no table of names, a command table without a handler of its own (-)
title-string:           Vt3
help-string:            Vt3 1.00
date-string:            10 Oct 2026

initialisation-code:    vt3_init
swi-chunk-base-number:  0x58D40
swi-handler-code:       v3_swi
swi-decoding-code:      v3_n2n/v3_n2s

command-keyword-table: -
  V3_Own(min-args: 0, max-args: 0, handler: v3_own),
  V3_Nothing(min-args: 0, max-args: 0)
